   Note that the CC BY 4.0 grant covers only the material deposited here. Third-
   party inputs retain their own terms:

   * step2_positive_docking/input/pdbs/NK2R.pdb derives from an AlphaFold2
     prediction (UniProt P21452). See docs/ALPHAFOLD_TERMS_OF_USE.md.
   * step2_positive_docking/input/pdbs/NK1R.pdb derives from PDB entry 6E59;
     NK3R.pdb from a predicted receptor model. Structures retrieved by Foldseek
     and listed in step3_foldseek_search/ and figures/tables/TableS3 are
     redistributed as identifiers and metadata only; consult the source
     databases (PDB, AlphaFold DB, BFVD and others) for their terms of use.

3. Scope of the claims
   --------------------
   Nothing in this repository is a validated pharmacological result. See the
   "Scope" section of README.md: structural neighbours are not confirmed
   off-targets, REF15 total model scores are not binding free energies, and no
   peptide here has been shown to bind, activate or selectively engage a
   neurokinin receptor.
